				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Presentation for [VISSOFT 2026](https://vissoft.io/2026/program.html). There is a combined MIP award for our [2016 paper](https://scg.unibe.ch/assets/scgbib/?query=Meri16a&filter=Author), as well as a presentation of our [2026 visions paper](https://www.overleaf.com/project/6a5b89c52b1182598e488132) (to appear on arxiv).\nTotal time for talk  questions: 40 m (i.e., 30+10)"
			},
