							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Use the data from the 2016 paper?\nSee the [replication package](https://scg.unibe.ch/research/visualisation-review).\nThe UTF-8 CSV link: [](https://scg.unibe.ch/download/merino/review-vissoft/dataset-utf8.zip).\nLet's explore: [[Exploring the Actionable Visualization replication package]]"
